---
import Chapter from './Chapter.astro';

---

<section class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl overflow-hidden px-4 py-14 sm:px-6">
  <p class="ghost-word -top-2 right-2 hidden text-[5.5rem] lg:block" aria-hidden="true">Speak</p>

  <Chapter num="03" label="Tentang Program" class="mb-6" />

  <div class="grid items-center gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-12">
    <div class="relative order-2 md:order-1">
      <div data-reveal="fade" class="relative rotate-[-1.5deg] overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border-4 border-white bg-white shadow-[0_24px_50px_-20px_rgba(27,27,31,0.3)] transition-transform duration-500 hover:rotate-0 aspect-4/3">
        <img
          src="/media/mic-kid.jpg"
          alt="Atlet muda memegang mikrofon PROSPECT di sesi Sports Communication"
          loading="lazy"
          width="857"
          height="1063"
          class="h-full w-full object-cover object-[50%_28%]"
          onerror="this.style.display='none'"
        />
        <p class="hl-brand absolute bottom-4 left-5 display text-xl italic">Berani Bicara.</p>
      </div>
      <div
        class="absolute -right-3 -bottom-3 hidden rounded-2xl border border-gold bg-paper px-4 py-3 shadow-xl sm:block"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <p class="display text-2xl text-brand-dark">2.175+</p>
        <p class="text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wider text-ink/70 uppercase">atlet teredukasi</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div data-reveal="fade" class="order-1 md:order-2">
      <p class="eyebrow text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-text uppercase">Tentang Sports Communication</p>
      <h2 class="display mt-3 text-4xl leading-[0.95] sm:text-5xl">
        Kenapa Sports Communication Penting?
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/70 sm:text-base">
        Karena <strong class="text-ink">Sports Communication</strong> mengajarkan keterampilan fundamental bagi
        anak dan calon atlet modern untuk berkembang dan naik ke level berikutnya.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/70 sm:text-base">
        Melalui <strong class="text-ink">Public Speaking</strong> dan <strong class="text-ink">Bahasa Inggris</strong> khusus
        atlet, anak akan belajar berkomunikasi dengan percaya diri, menghadapi media, berbicara dengan pelatih asing,
        wasit, serta ofisial, sehingga dapat membuka peluang lebih besar di dunia olahraga.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
